  "acceptance": [
    "Detached OpenSSH SSHSIG envelope binds the independently configured principal and exact integrity-checked bundle manifest.",
    "The allowed-signers policy is no-follow, regular, bounded to 1 MiB, copied into an anonymous memfd and fully sealed before verification.",
